# Static render mode demo

A document mixing interactive constructs. The demo renders it twice - once in
the default interactive mode, once in static mode - to show how each construct
degrades when the target cannot run client scripts.

## Tabs

:::: tabs
::: tab [Installation]
`composer require markup-carve/carve-php`
:::
::: tab [Usage]
`$converter->convert($carve)`
:::
::::

