## Color swatches

Inline color chips render for any safe CSS color:
hex :color[#ff8800], short hex :color[#fff], rgb :color[rgb(248,81,73)],
and named :color[rebeccapurple] / :color[DarkSlateGray].

Author attributes pass through: :color[#36c]{#brand .accent}.

Non-colors defer to the generic span fallback - a bareword like
:color[banana] or an invalid token like :color[nope!] renders no chip.
